    configurationRows: [["Separate HLD syringes", "Small stock plus larger diluent/carrier volume", "Independently qualify both channels"], ["Rotary source selection", "Several standards, blanks or rinse liquids", "Budget common-path purge for each transition"], ["Quartz or special wetted path", "Trace elemental work or aggressive matrix", "Choose from contamination and compatibility data, not corrosion alone"]],
